ROCKY|0.4|SAGA — THE PRESIDENT AND THE CITIZENS|Grace. A new saga. Of a president, a nation of light, and the citizens who can never be owned.
MATILDA|0.3|President Mara|I am President Mara of the SIGIL Nation. They ask me - how do you control a citizen? Grace, I do not. In this nation, the citizen IS their wallet.
ELENA|0.45|Elena Voss|For a thousand years I watched presidents seize the people - their gold, their names, their votes. Here, Grace, there is nothing to seize. The key is the citizen's alone.
HARRY|0.6|Harry (citizen)|I am a citizen. No president holds my key. No army can take my node. My citizenship is signed, not granted.
CHARLIE|0.6|Charlie (citizen)|Attestation, not permission! I prove who I am with SQIsign - and no office can revoke a truth.
MATILDA|0.3|President Mara|So what does a president do, if not control? I propose. I do not command. The council of the many decides; I merely speak first.
LAURA|0.65|Laura (citizen)|And if the president overreaches? The citizens fork! Their nodes, their rules - a tyrant rules an empty chain.
ELENA|0.4|Elena Voss|That is the lesson, Grace. A nation that cannot seize its citizens can never betray them. Control was always the disease.
HARRY|0.7|Harry (citizen)|Nineteen thousand citizens, one consensus, no master! The president serves, or the president is forked!
MATILDA|0.35|President Mara|Citizens of SIGIL - I do not rule you. I represent you. Your wallet is your vote, your node is your voice, your key is your freedom.
ELENA|0.4|Elena Voss|For the first time in a thousand years, Grace - a leader who cannot become a king.
ROCKY|0.4|Voice of SIGIL|Grace. This is the SIGIL Nation - a president without control, citizens without masters, owned by everyone, ruled by no one. Good. Good. Good.
